OL,3,GNEWSAMissing person winched from
OL,4,Acoastal rocks in helicopter rescue
OL,5,
OL,6,FA missing person has been winched to
OL,7,Fsafety from coastal rocks after a
OL,8,Frescue operation was launched in
OL,9,Fsouth-west Scotland.
OL,11,FStranraer RNLI lifeboat was called out
OL,12,Fto assist police in the search around
OL,13,FFinnarts Bay north of Loch Ryan at
OL,14,Fabout 15:45 on Wednesday.
OL,16,FWith daylight fading, the crew located
OL,17,Fthe casualty on rocks above the
OL,18,Fshoreline.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
