OL,3,GNEWSAMissing person winched from
OL,4,Acoastal rocks in helicopter rescue
OL,5,
OL,6,FDue to the "precarious position", an HM
OL,7,FCoastguard helicopter winched the
OL,8,Fperson aboard who was then transferred
OL,9,Finto the care of the Scottish Ambulance
OL,10,FService.
